        <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="f-1501_lbl" order="0" xlink:to="ft-1501_47421_lbl" />
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-07_47284_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p><span style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Schedule Page 102 Line No.: 1 Column: a</span></span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none">The following are the intermediary companies in the chain of ownership between Energy Transfer</span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none"> LP (DE) and </span><span style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: initial; text-align: inherit">ET CC Holdings LLC </span></span></span><span style="background-color: initial; text-align: inherit; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt">(DE): </span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit">Energy Transfer LP (DE) owns 100% of </span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"><span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); background-color: unset">ET CC Holdings LLC</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"> (DE). <span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: inherit; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: unset; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt"><span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); background-color: unset">ET CC Holdings LLC</span></span><span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: inherit; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; background-color: unset; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt"><span> </span>(DE)</span> owns 100% of </span><span style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">Mid Valley Pipeline Company LLC</span></span><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; background-color: unset; text-align: inherit"> (OH).</span><span style="font-size: 10pt"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><br /></span></span></p><p class="_Normal_"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal"><br /></span></p><p style="text-align: left; page-break-inside: auto; page-break-after: auto; page-break-before: avoid; line-height: 107.916664%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; line-height: 107.916664%"><br /></span></p><p style="text-align: left; page-break-inside: auto; page-break-after: auto; page-break-before: avoid; line-height: 107.916664%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"><span style="font-family: Calibri; font-size: 11pt; text-transform: none; font-weight: normal; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; line-height: 107.916664%"><br /><br /><br /><br /></span></p></div></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-150_47285_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto">Cash management program with Energy Transfer LP.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-491_47371_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $4.5 million is included in Account(s) 600.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-689_47300_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1); font-family: Roboto">Cash management program with Energy Transfer LP.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-935_47387_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Other Adjustments reflect asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1475_47388_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="text-align: left"><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: Roboto">Other Adjustments reflect asset reclassification that resulted in changes to the associated depreciation expense.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1481_47352_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Various</p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1501_47421_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div><p style="margin: 0 0 10px">In accordance with the Order Denying Rehearing, Denying Petition and Granting Remedies in Docket No. RM20-14-004 issued on November 20, 2025 footnote 111, we have determined that rebillings, as permitted in that Order, are not distortive. Accordingly, rebillings in the amount of $1,961,619 are included in line 10, interstate operating revenue. These revenues represent a one-time event and are not representative of future revenues.</p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px"> </p><p style="margin: 0 0 10px">The cost of service results were calculated using the Cost of Service Model. This Model calculates cost of service using the Trended Original Cost methodology promulgated by the FERC in Opinion No. 154-B, 31 FERC 61,377 (1985), as modified and clarified by subsequent rulings.</p></div></link:footnote>
    </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrl>